# scheduler (the 3a's A520 / A720 clusters as sheng's), the audio add-on mount, the optional source storage hook and its
# iPadOS 27 kernel bring-up. Its Wi-Fi and latency trace patches are left out.
zzye-sheng-cpu-idle.patch
zzyf-sheng-amp.patch
zzyd-sheng-audio-addon-mount.patch
source-storage-runtime.patch
zzzz-sheng-ipados27-bringup.patch
